<h1>Get the workshop project</h1>
<p>Each workshop ZIP contains two folders: <code>data</code> with the workshop datasets and <code>scripts</code> with <code>00_setup.R</code> and the practical scripts.</p>
<p>Combined project · v{{ participantPackage.version }} · <code>{{ participantPackage.filename }}</code></p>
{% if participantPackage.url %}
<p><a class="button" href="{{ participantPackage.url | escape }}">Open the project ZIP in Google Drive</a></p>
{% else %}
<p>Request the combined project ZIP from the workshop organizer. The restricted Google Drive link has yet to be added.</p>
{% endif %}
<h2>Open the project</h2>
<p>Extract the entire ZIP, keep <code>data</code> and <code>scripts</code> together, and open a script from <code>scripts</code> in RStudio. If Drive asks for access, sign in with your registered account.</p>
<p><a class="button" href="setup.html">Follow the one-time setup</a></p>
{% for course in courses %}
{% if course.release.url %}
<p><a href="{{ course.release.url | escape }}">{{ course.title }} individual project ZIP</a></p>
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
